            "en": "Updated the existing Community tweaks page with real locally available target-app icons, clear descriptions and compact action explanations. Authors can review the published revision against their latest local version, describe what changed and confirm a community update. Community revisions and dates are preserved; imported or used revisions can show when a newer update is available. Edit, update and delete are restricted to the original authenticated author device on the server, not just hidden in the interface. Existing local versions, upload provenance, source screenshots and feature guides are preserved. Not yet tested on a physical device.",
